{"name":"Floating Contact Button for MAX and Telegram","slug":"floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram","version":"1.2.2","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/alexwp12\/\">Alexander Alekseenko<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/alexwp12\/","contributors":{"alexwp12":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/alexwp12\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/4c87e6e84ab5a98ada0123d7abb46b99e12f903546b78e3bc0b47280ec79df6b?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"Alexander Alekseenko"}},"requires":"5.0","tested":"7.1.4","requires_php":"7.0","requires_plugins":[],"rating":100,"ratings":{"5":7,"4":0,"3":0,"2":0,"1":0},"num_ratings":7,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/","support_threads":0,"support_threads_resolved":0,"active_installs":1000,"last_updated":"2026-11-02 4:16pm GMT","added":"2025-08-16","homepage":"https:\/\/cryptolamer.ru\/support-the-plugin-floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram-eng\/","sections":{"description":"<p>Floating Contact Button for Telegram, WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger and MAX adds a clean, modern floating contact button to your WordPress site.<\/p>\n<p>The plugin allows visitors to quickly contact you via popular messengers using a compact floating menu that opens smoothly on click.<\/p>\n<p>\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer:<br \/>\nThis plugin is an independent project developed by the author and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to MAX Messenger, Telegram, WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger, or their respective owners.<\/p>\n<h3>Live Demo<\/h3>\n<p>https:\/\/cryptolamer.ru\/support-the-plugin-floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram-eng\/<\/p>\n<h3>Key Features<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Floating contact menu with smooth open animation<\/li>\n<li>Supported messengers:\n<ul>\n<li>Telegram<\/li>\n<li>WhatsApp<\/li>\n<li>Facebook Messenger<\/li>\n<li>MAX Messenger<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>Modern glass-style design (Apple-like UI)<\/li>\n<li>One main button with expandable contacts<\/li>\n<li>Individual enable\/disable for each messenger<\/li>\n<li>Drag &amp; drop button reordering (order is saved automatically)<\/li>\n<li>Manual button positioning (Top \/ Right \/ Bottom in pixels)<\/li>\n<li>Lightweight and fast (no external libraries)<\/li>\n<li>Privacy-friendly (no tracking, no external servers)<\/li>\n<li>Easy configuration via WordPress admin panel<\/li>\n<li>Fully tested with the free AirTheme WordPress theme<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Support the project:<br \/>\nIf the plugin was helpful, you can support its development with a cup of coffee.<\/p>\n","installation":"<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the \/wp-content\/plugins\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram directory, or install the plugin directly from the WordPress Plugins screen.<\/li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress.<\/li>\n<li>Go to Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">\u2192<\/span> Contact Button to configure your messenger links and button position.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n","faq":"\n<h4>\nIs this plugin free?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. All current features are available for free.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nIs this an official plugin for Telegram, WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger or MAX?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. This is an independent plugin and is not affiliated with any messenger services.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nDoes the plugin collect user data?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. The plugin does not collect, store or transmit any personal data.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nCan I disable individual messengers?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Each messenger can be enabled or disabled independently in the settings.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nCan I change the position of the button?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can manually set top, right or bottom offsets in pixels. Leave fields empty to use the default position.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<h4>\nWill more messengers be added?\n<\/h4>\n<p>\n<p>Possibly in future updates. The plugin is actively maintained.<\/p>\n<\/p>\n\n","changelog":"<h4>1.2.2<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility update: tested up to WordPress 7.1.4.<\/li>\n<li>No functional changes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.2.1<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed conflicting Top and Bottom position styles that could move the button to the top of the page.<\/li>\n<li>Clarified button position fields in the settings page.<\/li>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 7.1.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.2.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added helpful link placeholders for messenger settings.<\/li>\n<li>Added a quick five-star review link on the Plugins page.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.11<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated demo and support links in plugin metadata.<\/li>\n<li>No functional changes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.10<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility update: tested up to WordPress 7.0.<\/li>\n<li>No functional changes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.9<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added optional HTML signature comment for plugin discovery in page source.<\/li>\n<li>Improved admin translations.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.8<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed escaping warnings in frontend\/admin output for Plugin Check compliance.<\/li>\n<li>Synced plugin version and stable tag.<\/li>\n<li>Removed deprecated translation loader call.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.7<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed plugin naming to comply with WordPress guidelines<\/li>\n<li>Updated plugin metadata and readme<\/li>\n<li>Fixed broken Plugin URI link<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.6<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated contact button Pro links<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.5<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated plugin name for better search visibility<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.4<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Internal cleanup: removed system files and minor metadata refresh.<\/li>\n<li>No functional changes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.3<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add visibility settings (Desktop \/ Mobile display)<\/li>\n<li>Removed deprecated translation path (Domain Path)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.2<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added chat hint (text bubble near main button)<\/li>\n<li>Improved user interaction UX<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.1<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Facebook Messenger support.<\/li>\n<li>Added quick links to plugin rating page and PRO version in admin plugin list.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.1.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Live Demo section.<\/li>\n<li>Added blueprint.json for WordPress Playground demo support.<\/li>\n<li>Minor readme formatting improvements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.10<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved regional support link handling for RU locale.<\/li>\n<li>Removed deprecated file.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.9<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed admin settings saving issue.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.8<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and internal improvements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.7<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor readme.txt refinements.<\/li>\n<li>Improved plugin header consistency.<\/li>\n<li>Updated version metadata for proper release propagation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.6<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved admin interface stability.<\/li>\n<li>Added visual availability indicator for the main button.<\/li>\n<li>Minor frontend behavior and style refinements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.5<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enabled direct link to PRO button addon.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.4<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added drag &amp; drop reordering for buttons.<\/li>\n<li>Improved button settings layout with collapsible sections.<\/li>\n<li>Enhanced admin UI clarity and usability.<\/li>\n<li>Minor UI and code improvements.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.3<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added manual button positioning.<\/li>\n<li>Added support link.<\/li>\n<li>Improved admin UI clarity.<\/li>\n<li>Minor code cleanup.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.2<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility update for WordPress 6.9.<\/li>\n<li>Added WhatsApp support.<\/li>\n<li>New expandable floating menu.<\/li>\n<li>Updated modern glass-style UI.<\/li>\n<li>Improved frontend animations.<\/li>\n<li>Code cleanup and improved translations.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.1<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility update for WordPress 6.8.<\/li>\n<li>Improved readme formatting.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>1.0.0<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First public release.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","screenshots":"<ol><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=3435355\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/assets\/screenshot-1.png?rev=3435355\" alt=\"Plugin settings page in WordPress admin\"><\/a><p>Plugin settings page in WordPress admin<\/p><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/assets\/screenshot-2.png?rev=3345691\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/assets\/screenshot-2.png?rev=3345691\" alt=\"Floating contact button on the frontend\"><\/a><p>Floating contact button on the frontend<\/p><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/assets\/screenshot-3.png?rev=3435366\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ps.w.org\/floating-contact-button-for-max-and-telegram\/assets\/screenshot-3.png?rev=3435366\" alt=\"Expanded contact menu with multiple messengers\"><\/a><p>Expanded contact menu with multiple messengers<\/p><\/li><\/ol>","reviews":"<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">\u041f\u043b\u0430\u0433\u0438\u043d \u0441\u0443\u043f\u0435\u0440.<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/utskra\/\"><img alt='' src='h